Goal: (and (RW:cw sub7 sub3) (RW:cw sub6 g11) (RW:cw sub5 g84) (RW:cw sub4 sub7) (RW:cw sub3 sub6) (RW:cw sub2 sub4) (RW:cw sub1 sub5) (RW:cw g84 sub2) (RW:cw g11 sub1) (RW:normal sub6) (RW:normal sub5) (RW:normal sub4) (RW:normal sub2) (RW:normal sub1) (RW:normal g84) (RW:normal g11) (RW:inverted sub7) (RW:inverted sub3))
